---
---

<section id="top" class="hero-section">
  <div class="hero-bg-clouds" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="cloud cloud-1"></div>
    <div class="cloud cloud-2"></div>
    <div class="cloud cloud-3"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container hero-content">
    <div class="hero-badge">
      <span class="badge-dot"></span>
      <span>Game Programmer / Client Engineer</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="hero-title">
      ゲームプログラマー<br />
      <span class="highlight-text">小林 純也</span> のポートフォリオ
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-lead">
      Unity と C# を軸に、ダンジョン自動生成などのアルゴリズムや物理シミュレーションの実装に情熱を注ぐ学生エンジニアです。
      「触っていて心地よい挙動」と「堅牢なロジック設計」を大切にゲーム開発に取り組んでいます。
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#featured" class="btn btn-primary">
        <span>代表作（Featured）を見る</span>
        <svg
          width="18"
          height="18"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2.5"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
        >
          <path d="M7 13l5 5 5-5M7 6l5 5 5-5"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a href="#about" class="btn btn-outline">
        <span>私について（About）</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .container {
    max-width: 1060px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 5.5rem 0 4.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f0f9ff 0%, #ffffff 100%);
    overflow: hidden;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
  }

  .hero-bg-clouds {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .cloud {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(
      circle,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9) 0%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 70%
    );
  }

  .cloud-1 {
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    top: -100px;
    right: -100px;
    background: radial-gradient(
      circle,
      rgba(72, 184, 236, 0.15) 0%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 70%
    );
  }

  .cloud-2 {
    width: 320px;
    height: 320px;
    bottom: -50px;
    left: -80px;
    background: radial-gradient(
      circle,
      rgba(255, 153, 182, 0.12) 0%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 70%
    );
  }

  .cloud-3 {
    width: 250px;
    height: 250px;
    top: 30%;
    right: 20%;
    background: radial-gradient(
      circle,
      rgba(72, 184, 236, 0.08) 0%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 70%
    );
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 820px;
  }

  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(72, 184, 236, 0.3);
    padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-cloud-sm);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .badge-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--color-primary);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(72, 184, 236, 0.2);
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .highlight-text {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary) 0%, #258fc3 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .hero-lead {
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    color: var(--color-text-body);
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto 2.25rem;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 2.1rem;
    }

    .hero-lead {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
